    cml:operator "Recurring" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Recurring nature of judge's or magistrate's oppressive behavior" ;
    cml:premiseText "(judge or magistrate is required or authorised by law to admit a person accused of an offence to bail)" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The judge's or magistrate's oppressive behavior must be recurring if it requires excessive and unreasonable bail." ;
