    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of rescuing a prisoner from criminal detention." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person rescues the prisoner from that detention by force; and  (c) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person rescues the prisoner from that detention by force; and  (c) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention." ;
